00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.450
That's the argument for not.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:18.570
Voting for Joe Biden, tweeting mug shots of
black people charged with crimes.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:23.930
These are posts from the verified Twitter
account, Trump War Room. Trump War Room is

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:28.730
an official account run by the Trump 2020
campaign team.

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:32.529
And they have been tweeting images like this
one that we're putting up on the screen for

00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:36.590
our video audience of a black man charged
with violent crimes.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:39.710
Remember, in our system, you are innocent
until proven guilty.

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:43.500
They're very quick to talk about that when
it comes to sexual assault allegations against

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.710
people like Donald Trump.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:49.220
But again, they're highlighting charges against
someone.

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:52.630
Another example that they tweeted out of a
guy named Dunovant Boone.

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:55.579
Also black charged with crimes.

00:00:55.579 --> 00:00:59.310
And there's a ton of these that they've been
tweeting out claiming that these are people

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:08.390
that are free, thanks to Biden campaign officials
who donated to pay bail fees.

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:10.360
So this is both No.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:17.280
One, completely obvious and transparent in
terms of it's just a racist attack to try

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.220
to hurt Joe Biden.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:24.490
And number two, and this is the part that
I hate to admit, but really it's an indictment

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:26.560
